            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Woe to the shepherds who destroy and scatter the sheep of my pasture!” says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, concerning the shepherds who care for my people: “You have scattered my flock, and have driven them away, and you have not attended to them. Behold, I will attend to you for your evil doings, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I will gather the remnant of my flock out of all the countries where I have driven them, and I will bring them back to their fold, and they shall be fruitful and multiply. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will set shepherds over them who will care for them, and they shall fear no more, nor be dismayed, neither shall any be missing, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
