          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Therefore, behold, the days are coming, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when men shall no longer say, ‘As the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lives who brought up the people of Israel out of the land of Egypt,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but ‘As the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lives who brought up and led the descendants of the house of Israel out of the north country and out of all the countries where he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " had driven them.’ Then they shall dwell in their own land.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
